{"about_the_game":"Free, easy to use &amp; efficient aim trainer.<br />\r\nImprove your aim on exercises made specifically for the game you wanna imrpove at!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn aim trainer created by players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs passionate gamers with a strong desire to improve, we naturally became interested in aim training.<br />\r\nAfter experimenting with various options, we realized that none of the existing aim trainers fully satisfied our needs. This is where the idea for AimX was born, a simple and intuitive aim trainer designed to provide players with exercises that are specifically tailored to the game they want to practice for.<br />\r\nPlayers don't need 10'000+ exercises but only the ones that will help them improve the most.<br />\r\nIn the long term, AimX will analyze each player\u2019s strengths and weaknesses to provide customized exercises.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe want AimX to interact with its community in the way we wish all games would:  listening to players, taking their feedback, needs and preferences into account to evolve in the right direction.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2724640?t=1728568529","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1728568529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728568529","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1728568529","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Free, easy to use &amp; efficient aim trainer.<br />\r\nImprove your aim on exercises made specifically for the game you wanna imrpove at!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn aim trainer created by players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs passionate gamers with a strong desire to improve, we naturally became interested in aim training.<br />\r\nAfter experimenting with various options, we realized that none of the existing aim trainers fully satisfied our needs. This is where the idea for AimX was born, a simple and intuitive aim trainer designed to provide players with exercises that are specifically tailored to the game they want to practice for.<br />\r\nPlayers don't need 10'000+ exercises but only the ones that will help them improve the most.<br />\r\nIn the long term, AimX will analyze each player\u2019s strengths and weaknesses to provide customized exercises.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe want AimX to interact with its community in the way we wish all games would:  listening to players, taking their feedback, needs and preferences into account to evolve in the right direction.","developers":["Aimx Sarl"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724640/header.jpg?t=1728568529","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257054178,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054178/movie480.mp4?t=1727770928","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054178/movie_max.mp4?t=1727770928"},"name":"AimX trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257054178/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1727770928","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054178/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1727770928","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257054178/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1727770928"}}],"name":"AIMX","package_groups":[],"pc_requ